	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nNavXrZRRZ6FrfJiK",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 7, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 10, HP 7, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 10, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1xwpmI4_eFwuTzuo",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 4, protection -3), threat tier minor, appearing 10."
		},
		{
			"id": "nQAvA178C41e_8giq",
			"text": "Sling: Sling (11): 1d-3 crushing, Reach Ranged, 60. From a ledge, in the dark, at a party already dealing with something else."
		},
		{
			"id": "nhU_DH87xq20PySSi",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/kobold.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nR9QgA274FDuTG3a6",
			"text": "Independent build total: -14 points of racial traits plus 26 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuF_X4coWp_28MG5X",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Kobold (SRD 5.1); Kobold (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTfp7s9pSpE8RM4OP",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbFQ9GHsGhEVW0DV6",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 20 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "n9OEc-7osZdQJfmoh",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nIXBS17M3NpuuM_Su",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1SOKQAWPPRjWur3I",
			"text": "About 0.9 m standing, which is the SM -2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nqJdUqSrfyl72j3sT",
			"text": "ST 7: the weakest folk in this batch. Everything dangerous about a kobold happens before the fight starts."
		},
		{
			"id": "nr_pd7i35oxIhYIwH",
			"text": "Cold-Blooded is bought at published cost. Kobolds are reptiles and a cold gallery genuinely slows them down, which is worth a GM knowing."
		},
		{
			"id": "nT3CV012IY8A1RZ1M",
			"text": "The traps are not built as attacks on this record. A pit is terrain the kobold made, not a thing the kobold does in a turn, and putting it on the stat block would rate every individual kobold as though it carried the whole mine around."
		},
		{
			"id": "n39OyH1Ckcp8S7im4",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
	"created_date": "1970-01-01T00:00:00Z",
